<item>
<title>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:54:04 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏</b><br/><br/>中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字节跳动旗下AI助手“豆包”公关负责人，以及中国官媒近日先后发声反驳。<br/><br/>“豆包”公关负责人刘星和官媒针对有中国企业披露数据指，中国人工智能词元（Token）消耗55%用于短剧及视频生成，软件开发仅占15%，以及有自媒体对比中美数据，声称美国约58%的Token用于代码生成及企业自动化的说法作出回应。刘星质疑数据“不靠谱”，官媒强调，中国AI发展没有跑偏，无需崇洋媚外、妄自菲薄。<br/><br/>但台媒引述另一名中国AI业者称，据其了解，中国确实有超过50%的Token用于视频生成。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80">#科技</a> <a href="?q=%23AI">#AI</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A">#企业</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/><br/>《中央社》<a href="https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610200105.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">报告：中国AI算力55%用在制作短剧及影音</a><br/>《星岛头条》<a href="https://www.stheadline.com/zh-hans/realtime-china/3627694/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">豆包反驳过半AI算力制爽剧 指母企仅用1成Token造片</a><br/>《人民日报》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34286985" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人民锐评：把“火药”做成“烟花”？警惕“中国AI跑偏论”</a><br/>《联合报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7333/9824560" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陆国内超半数算力造「爽剧」引热议陆业者：确实超50%用在图像生成</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/lbSzqyBvN9UrriERX6jpACy9kuxTu3I8ZQ0kLyjP_ygKUX4jZ-zvblgwRmvZSc1wnUv045zTKF-xkx0y94G2jlHz6FCCjP94-2UYlCsiaSV1ZqJk_IVlYq1vACMxK6sB_c_WfvZJUj4OzN2cAy3qNdTBFTKL9-yEcTDKLyskhjZd9Llz6zqITvlM7Gz63J97pHkkI5dL-imBlLIILCodMd3CE_llwa9ZyVje4QTgXkmOIRbAbjYkOIKqsNnTkJ1r9Tl9dIvJ8C3-aI4SGOqilMdkxKecCiJQt5l7QLXqTjtgtZx6yptCTwzO9p0XDw0AwbE_SIoomCOvOlOpkUzclQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/aFnyYglx-Wl-RzmM8saR_FdKxROsmX7vFqgwW6cM9u_AL4595EhDi9_7xOKbrOO_CI8opx2NmXdCwBO94sLA25BKI8tWQ4Ip1kWBFZvEHw16pBbm6Fa5QoQL6m80Y0ITCkJI0ZB9C75XHUebYqdLGX58dN1A5uT7GSiqUtkD9NYtVK0_bucjp9_rp3aadKHv-B6g-jNS_2KVA6-B8pdB33ydmnKT_-IRq-jkaUkCGM_-vX6co0FKrCQB6dzMEJA0gvBeP_QR2tA4YA6B6y3GKRqzyYo-JY7M1W4qX7M0c-Mh4dtMwr3T9wayG3ZFmeRUW3ZOw2ma9Msvts47XYlE6Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/m_oxQdFjDYH3BE8pphm5P8cqkE1nsy5SaR_igiQMubE9Tgx36WAIIPnh4ZfjNhDiegLGvyVaITGEQojWJxCEpJOp8widFwpaL6bC3icSw8kod6G7NB-mMa2pcaCL70YBLLyZrtOtbO3yuo2FKhqCySzU_98Dc1TDwv7eoj-udYkBKgjOA_e_OX75b1Hoe_SScKALfeqOuPdDz1dODQnr_fpR0vh2dBUhXnBFeBbrG3j_SCf2dd_E89a2OM4lukOkQ4QNX5ZGTNMVUdMzyRN9kLZlTdGyJnLFzC30Q5Dgwa6qYiQl7RjuJmlFZTBIuimW5jywitP7nBrE233zbWNOwQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/U0nd-MwbqayHY2Rh4RvHFJoNQsTJizwfhpIAHrR3gFYe3aKearHyYtrvN6zTt0CkDA0G7pVzZDUJdxjEC17OgVy7HAyGK9Kl9_2r8KJn_JfcGbFqb4cAaBAt4ZDiyr9mz3QWaN1HUTdhEWUpc3XhLZuK6VCS5wtUHURcn8cG5dQwy3jcZv3KZNmewYKYQ3EYy4zT0etXZfIO3sMDUlOliK41a52jZq1qH8RNEmF5RdG994Jo8Tkhj28UPVQip5l_cpJ9r3pT2oK3_IhQ4DKcXypD2SYHe8qDbHIoNYHy7Htx6mNNuyX2484ZlmpzbUuyxFPUX67Xt9Ac5iNK8awpzg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4B7.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
